# "/" serves the prerendered homepage (scripts/prerender.ts). A 200 rewrite is
# applied before asset matching, so it wins over dist/index.html, which stays
# the empty app shell. Every other path with no file of its own falls through
# to Pages' SPA fallback (no top-level 404.html), which serves /index.html.
# The former "/* /index.html 200" line was ignored by Pages as an infinite loop.
/ /prerender/home 200
